# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored; never commit real keys.
#
# Your OpenAI key. Required — it is what actually pays for and produces images.
# Needs access to gpt-image-2.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-...

# Optional. A Vercel AI Gateway key, created with:
#   vercel ai-gateway api-keys create --name asset-studio --limit 25 --refresh-period monthly
#
# When set, generation routes through the gateway in BYOK mode: the gateway
# authenticates your Vercel team but calls OpenAI with OPENAI_API_KEY above, so
# OpenAI still bills you and Vercel adds no markup, while you get spend
# tracking, per-key budgets, tagging and request logs.
#
# The gateway answers 403 customer_verification_required until the team has a
# card on file, even in BYOK mode. Until then the studio falls back to calling
# OpenAI directly and says so in the response. Nothing breaks either way.
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=vck_...
